            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86450, Freestone Square Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Freestone Cabinet Knob is part of Emtek's Urban Modern Collection. This stylish cabinet handle is the best of transitional decor design. Choose from one of 6 modern finishes. The Freestone Square Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCheck out the entire <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=freestone\"><b>Emtek Freestone Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Freestone Square Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86451-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Freestone Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86450: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86451: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
